{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21736","headline":"酬乐天雪中见寄 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天雪中见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知君夜听风萧索，晓望林亭雪半糊。\n撼落不教封柳眼，埽来偏尽附梅株。\n敲扶密竹枝犹亚，煦暖寒禽气渐苏。\n坐觉湖声迷远浪，回惊云路在长途。\n钱塘湖上苹先合，梳洗楼前粉暗铺。\n石立玉童披鹤氅，台施瑶席换龙须。\n满空飞舞应爲瑞，寡和高歌只自娱。\n莫遣拥帘伤思妇，且将盈尺慰农夫。\n称觞彼此情何异，对景东西事有殊。\n镜水遶山山尽白，琉璃云母世间无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}